14. Innovation
The main innovative aspect of EduGenie is the combination of generative AI and personalized education.
Instead of providing only fixed educational content, EduGenie can dynamically generate responses according to the student's request.
For example, the same topic can be presented as:
Beginner explanation → Detailed explanation → Short notes → 5-mark answer → Quiz
This makes the learning experience more adaptable.
