16. Final Ideation Statement
EduGenie is envisioned as an intelligent, interactive, and personalized learning assistant powered by Google Gemini. The brainstorming phase identified major student learning difficulties and converted them into AI-based solutions such as question answering, summarization, personalized explanations, quiz generation, and study-material creation. The project aims to make learning simpler, faster, more interactive, and accessible to students whenever they need academic assistance.
